chat-radio-fec-marsoc = MARSOC

fec-job-name-marsoc-operative = MARSOC Operative
fec-job-name-marsoc-commander = MARSOC Commander
fec-job-name-marsoc-curator = MARSOC Curator
fec-job-desc-marsoc-operative = A member of USCM High Command's personal unit. Answers to the MARSOC Commander and Curator.
fec-job-desc-marsoc-commander = The only commander of the MARSOC team on an operation and its squad leader. Answers to the MARSOC Curator.
fec-job-desc-marsoc-curator = A High Command officer overseeing the MARSOC team from the admin base. Outranks the Commander and Operatives.
fec-job-prefix-marsoc-curator = Cur.

fec-ghost-role-marsoc-operative = You are a MARSOC Operative, the personal unit of USCM High Command. The best of the best, picked from the elite of the marines. You answer only to High Command and carry out any order. No compromises, only results.
fec-ghost-role-marsoc-commander = You are the MARSOC Commander, the only commander of the team on this operation. Lead the Operatives and report to the Curator. No compromises, only results.
fec-ghost-role-marsoc-curator = You are the MARSOC Curator, a High Command officer. You stay at the admin base, support the team, answer questions and set objectives. You outrank the Commander and Operatives.
fec-ghost-role-marsoc-curator-rules = Your role: [color=red][bold]MARSOC Curator[/bold][/color]. This role is only granted by admins. Do not leave the admin base without admin permission.
